    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be assessed as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds (req:req55): our platform Atelier has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds, which suggests our can meet this requirement for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement for common queries is FULLY COVERED. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with existing information systems and user directories (con:con63, con:con65): Our platform Atelier supports API-first design (REST + webhook) and has connectors and adapters for various business tools, including accounting-production and payroll software, document-management systems, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our support single sign-on (SSO) with protocols like SAML and OIDC, and integration with user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thus, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU (con:con42): our offer a Sovereign tier hosting option through OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, the EU-only, and renewable-powered. a Sovereign tier hosting option meets The client sovereignty and compliance requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers (con:con68): Since our can host the solution on OuraneCloudider, and Our platform Atelier is designed to be model-agnostic with options for sovereign European open-weight models hosted by our, our do not introduce dependencies on non-European suppliers for critical components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This requirement is FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Architecture: Proposed Architecture would involve deploying Our platform Atelier on the Sovereign tier of OuraneCloud, ensuring that all data remains within the EU and is handled by a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure. our would integrate Our platform Atelier with The client existing information systems using our API-first approach, connecting to The client accounting-production software, payroll software, document-management systems (GED), and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For user authentication and authorization, our would implement SSO using protocols like SAML or OIDC, integrating with the client's user directory (e.g., LDAP, Entra ID) to ensure seamless access for authorized personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures that the client's requirements for sovereignty, security, and performance are met while providing a scalable and reliable solution for the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform Atelier retrieval-augmented generation capabilities, combined with Our platform Atelier orchestration layer and answer layer features, will provide the client with an intelligent assistance tool that can support the client professionals in daily activities, such as drafting documents, handling client files, and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By hosting an intelligent assistance tool that can support their professionals in daily activities, such as drafting documents, handling client files, and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements on sovereign the EU infrastructure and leveraging European models and suppliers where possible, our align with the client strategic and regulatory preferences." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance (req:req38), professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data (req:req34, con:con35), and encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable (con:con43)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with accounting standards PCG, tax doctrine and the tax code CGI, the commercial code, and applicable legal texts collective bargaining agreements for payroll social and internal procedures and methodology guides (con:con20, con:con22)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security and regulatory compliance risks should we flag, and are we compliant?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certification demonstrates we commitment to information security management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we hold an ISO 27701 certification, which is a privacy information management extension, indicating we ability to manage personal data in accordance with GDPR and other privacy regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding encryption, we use TLS 1.3 for encryption in transit and AES-256 for encryption at rest. we key management is based on EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that sensitive data is handled securely. we also implement strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we have pseudonymisation and data minimisation measures in place, as well as configurable retention aligned to legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for regulatory compliance, we experience includes delivering services to clients bound by professional secrecy, such as a national professional order. we are familiar with the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT) and understand the importance of not undermining a firm's reporting obligations. we control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, allowing for audit evidence production." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we should flag potential risks related to ensuring that we solution meets all specific accounting standards PCG, tax doctrine, and the tax code CGI requirements, as potential risks related to ensuring that our solution meets all specific accounting standards PCG, tax doctrine, and the tax code CGI requirements are not explicitly mentioned in we context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we have experience with GDPR and general regulatory compliance, the specificity of GDPR and general regulatory compliance may require additional review or assurance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, based on the information provided in our context, we appear to be compliant with many aspects of the client's requirements, including GDPR, professional secrecy, confidentiality, encryption, and pseudonymisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, a deeper review is recommended to ensure full compliance with all specified accounting standards and tax regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
